# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Whitelist .gitignore
#
# Everything at the repository root is ignored by default. Only the files and
# folders that belong to the mod are re-included below, so local files
# (personal build settings, release archives, audit logs, IDE state) never end
# up in the repository by accident.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/*

# Repository meta
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.editorconfig
!/.github/

# Documentation shipped with the mod
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/CHANGELOG.md

# Build entry points
!/PartyLearningLoot.sln
!/Directory.Build.props
!/GamePath.user.props.example

# Mod source code
!/PartyLearningLoot/

# Build output and IDE state inside the source folder stay local
/PartyLearningLoot/bin/
/PartyLearningLoot/obj/
/PartyLearningLoot/.vs/
/PartyLearningLoot/**/*.user
/PartyLearningLoot/**/*.suo
/PartyLearningLoot/**/*.DotSettings.user
/PartyLearningLoot/Logs/
